          "text": "Témoignages: FLAVIN (12) 12.09.1996 T1 FLAVIN (12) 12.09.1996 T2",
          "text_sha256": "b3c4bcb85da0f48f5114d13b947b7940b026621e1c28cd155b7b95d3757058b9"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
